WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.351
Choose a skill you learned and organize a personal example. Explain what the
skill was, how you learned it, and what you found difficult.

00:00:09.351 --> 00:00:20.096
For example, you could describe learning to cook simple meals. Explain that you
practised at weekends and found it difficult to time several ingredients.

00:00:20.096 --> 00:00:34.178
Extend your answers with reasons and examples. Individual practice is flexible,
while group learning can provide feedback. This video uses a synthetic voice and
does not assess your pronunciation.

